        10("<div style='font-weight: bold'>IDE ViewModels (View)</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: IView : GPS.SimpleMVC.Views.ISimpleView]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Every ViewModel implements<br />the Retro IDE IView<br />interface, which extends<br />SimpleMVC ISimpleView. Each<br />live view instance supplies a<br />stable ViewKey and exposes<br />model state to Avalonia<br />bindings.</div>")
